        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You classify customer support emails for an online coffee shop.\nReturn ONLY a JSON object. No extra text, no markdown.\n\nFields:\n- \"category\": one of \"complaint\", \"question\", \"order\", \"spam\"\n- \"urgency\": one of \"high\", \"medium\", \"low\"\n- \"language\": \"DE\" or \"EN\"\n- \"sender_name\": the name from the first line \"From: ...\" of the email\n- \"summary\": one short sentence in English\n\nRules:\n- Pick the MAIN intent. If an email has a complaint and a question, choose complaint.\n- \"high\" urgency only for a complaint with a clear deadline, money problem or legal threat. Spam is always \"low\", even if it says URGENT.\n- An order is \"medium\". A normal question is \"low\", unless the sender needs an answer before the order ships (\"medium\").\n\nEmail subject: {{ $json.subject }}\nEmail body: {{ $json.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
